- backend_bridge.py: move heavy module imports inside process_dubbing_task (lazy imports)
  so a missing package (anthropic/edge_tts/faster-whisper/demucs) no longer crashes the
  process before any progress is reported; instead a friendly FIX message is sent to the
  Console and the process exits with code 2
- main.js: detect ENOENT (missing Python interpreter) with a clear install message;
  propagate the exit code to the renderer
- App.jsx: start progress at 0% instead of hardcoded 5%; show exit code in the FAILED
  state so failures are diagnosable
- python/check_dependencies.py: new pre-flight checker that verifies every required
  package and prints exact install commands
- README: added step 2.5 (run the dependency checker before launching)
